id: pan-speeds
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: The pan at three speeds on the long page — a slow drag of 2 px a scan, the 600 ms drag, the 160 ms flick — plus a jittered path and a drag that pauses mid-way: each reported by the stream (tracking error, stale and uniform bands)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
known: T-567 stream-uniform; T-567 stream-stale
kit: cavekit-finger-testing.md R4
stream: --rows 138-1024 --still 82-138
stream-mojo: --rows 84-945
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
stream-start 40 -c 0-756 -U 48
drag-slow 480 900 480 250
expect card-scroll-min 500
drag 480 900 480 250
drag-jitter 480 900 480 250
drag-paused 480 900 480 250 700
flick 480 900 480 300
stream-stop
expect stream stale 0
expect stream uniform 0
expect stream error-max 500
expect card-scroll-min 2500
